   <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">Every semi-solid state OEM order should include these four documents in the pre-shipment package. Absence of any is grounds to hold the deposit.</p>

   <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-6">
    <table class="w-full text-sm border-collapse">
     <thead class="bg-brandBlue text-white"><tr><th class="p-3 text-left">#</th><th class="p-3 text-left">Document</th><th class="p-3 text-left">What It Proves</th></tr></thead>
